{"step_index":801,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:12:34Z","thinking":"Extracted and mapped key data points from the webpage, including the establishment year (2009), establishment month (4), contact number (051-207-3530), fax number (051-517-3500), and employee count (10), noting the company's \"continued business\" status. This data is being translated into the appropriate format.\n\n\nThe instruction to populate all missing data points for companies with business numbers is clear; the identified URL provides the necessary information. Need to iterate through the dataset to locate all companies with business registration numbers and corresponding URLs. Extracting and recording the information for each company is the next step.\n\n\nConfirmed the need to populate all missing data fields for the 150 companies with existing business registration numbers, using bizno.net as the source. Extraction will include establishment year/month, contact/fax numbers, and address updates. This requires iterating through the identified rows, fetching data from the specified URLs, and matching the retrieved information.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst fs = require('fs');\n\nconst list = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/filled_companies_summary.json', 'utf8'));\n\nasync function fetchBizno(bizno) {\n    const clean = bizno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    const url = 'https://bizno.net/article/' + clean;\n    return new Promise(resolve => {\n        https.get(url, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0' } }, res => {\n            let d = '';\n            res.on('data', c => d += c);\n            res.on('end', () => {\n                const info = {};\n                // 등록일: e.g. 2009-04-20\n                const regM = d.match(/<th>등록일<\\/th>\\s*<td>(.*?)<\\/td>/s);\n                if (regM) info.regDate = regM[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n\n                // 전화번호\n                const telM = d.match(/<th>전화번호<\\/th>\\s*<td>(.*?)<\\/td>/s);\n                if (telM) info.tel = telM[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n\n                // 팩스번호\n                const faxM = d.match(/<th>팩스번호<\\/th>\\s*<td>(.*?)<\\/td>/s);\n                if (faxM) info.fax = faxM[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n\n                // 종업원수\n                const empM = d.match(/<th>종업원수<\\/th>\\s*<td>(.*?)<\\/td>/s);\n                if (empM) info.employees = empM[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n\n                // 상태\n                const stM = d.match(/<th>사업자 현재 상태<\\/th>\\s*<td>(.*?)<\\/td>/s);\n                if (stM) info.status = stM[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ').trim();\n\n                resolve(info);\n            });\n        }).on('error', () => resolve({}));\n    });\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        const item = list[i];\n        const info = await fetchBizno(item.bizno);\n        console.log(item.rowNumber, item.name, item.bizno, info);\n    }\n}\nrun();\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\fill_missing_business_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":15000,"toolAction":"Testing field extraction on 5 companies","toolSummary":"Test field extraction from Bizno"}}]}
